3932:
# THE MATCH IS PLAYED OUT, and that is what is asserted - through the OS-EGRESS ledger, which
# does not depend on where anything lives in memory. The CPU wins the match (Kasumi is K.O.'d
# ~f6300 on the desktop), the title shows "You got a new title! KASUMI NEWBIE" and WRITES
# save_sys.dat (desktop f6733). The boot autosave (f1997) writes the same file, hence `at>=6000`.
# Margin to f7800 because the fight starts later in the browser than on the desktop.
7800: @assert egress SaveWrite path=savedata0:/save_sys.dat at>=6000
